 "description": "Grade a Kazakhstan market-entry file against a staged source-requirement taxonomy before a launch, budget, or partner commitment. Returns a gate decision, readiness label, evidence gaps, claim audit, owner actions, and watch-next indicators. Required tool arguments: project_name, partner_or_company, market, decision_question, decision_stage, supplied_sources. Grades supplied evidence; it does not independently verify source truth. Obtain the source records requested by inputSchema before asking for a decision-ready result. Do not fabricate missing evidence. Illustrative example arguments (synthetic; replace with your own data): {\"project_name\":\"Example EV distribution entry\",\"partner_or_company\":\"Example Motors Ltd\",\"market\":\"Kazakhstan\",\"decision_question\":\"Is this entry ready for a pre-signature human review?\",\"decision_stage\":\"pre_signature\",\"supplied_sources\":[{\"id\":\"me-1\",\"source_type\":\"user_provided_note\",\"title\":\"Partner background note\",\"date\":\"2026-08-01\"}]}. This product offers two free trial attempts at /v1/trial; shared networks share the allowance and daily capacity is limited. Evaluation on paid endpoints requires a signed Base USDC payment for the exact request, or Pro access. Discovery is free. Keep the original request and X-Payment-Signature for result recovery within 24 hours. Current prices: https://kazakhstan-market-entry-readiness-a2a.vassiliy-lakhonin.workers.dev/.well-known/x402. Do not pay automatically. Evidence triage only: no factual-truth verification, no legal, compliance, sanctions, or financial advice. Human review is required before any commercial action.",
